WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
This is my Simple Calculator, written in Python.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I enter the first number, 12, and the operator +.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
I enter the second number, 30, and press enter.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The result is 42.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Thank you for watching this quick demo!

